der-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Peninsula\">Orc Peninsula</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/insectoid-invasion-world-change\">Insectoid Invasion World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-roost-of-the-graveborn-quest\">The Roost of the Graveborn Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.4<br/>November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Greenshore</b> is a small community to the north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>. A peninsula with a mountain pass into it, it is very quiet and safe at the surface with a small number of lesser creatures. The main sights to see in Greenshore are <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Tibianic\">The Tibianic</a> as well as the expensive Greenshore Villa. Near the mountain pass, there is a hole leading to the main Thais dungeon filled with many <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Spearman\">Orc Spearmen</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>. Many huge events take place there, due to the \"presence\" of the Tibianic.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Map_of_Greenshore\">Map of Greenshore</span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Tibianic\">The Tibianic</a></li>\n<li>Crop fields</li>\n<li>Town center</li>\n<li>The way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></li></ol>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Greenshore NPCs (3 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ulrik\">Ulrik</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ulrik\"><img alt=\"Ulrik\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ulrik_ff6dac.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Artisan</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Greenshore</strong> village.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tokel\">Tokel</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tokel\"><img alt=\"Tokel\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tokel_50cce4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Farmer</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink